{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c30c1f93c75e470b","name":"Jawa Trader","source":{"id":"source:reference-c30c1f93c75e470b","title":"Jawa Trader","revision":21639,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:11:43Z","sha256":"12d89de6f6815a100ddd216f4f13968980ef2d0b9e53af829a9a0d59efb18810","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21639","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jawa%20Trader&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c30c1f93c75e470b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Wars Miniatures Previews"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["\"Utinni!\""]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jawas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jawas"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tatooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tatooine","referenceId":"reference:a1b911e88e4876e1"}," visitors and residents alike regard these small creatures as deceitful and conniving. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jawas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jawas"}," are well-known scavengers that comb the desert for bits of scrap or abandoned technology they can patch up and sell to the planet's far-flung residents. Of course, a Jawa's opinion of what is abandoned doesn't always match that of the owner of the item in question, and more than one unlucky farmer has had to buy their own Droid back from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sandcrawler"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sandcrawler","referenceId":"reference:79940a5d4b9f0ebf"},". Still, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jawas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jawas"}," provide a useful (if annoying) service, and their sales form the backbone of their economy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Central to this process are Jawa Traders, experienced ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jawas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jawas"}," that have marginally better social and dealmaking skills than average members of their Species. These traders can't be trusted any more than other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jawas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jawas"},"- in fact, they can probably be trusted less- but they can facilitate local deals or locate obscure technology, which can come in handy in the middle of a desert planet. Of course, a buyer must understand the Jawa Trade Language to negotiate a deal, and they'd better learn it well or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jawas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jawas"}," will use the communication gap to their advantage. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Jawa Trader Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Small ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jawa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jawa","referenceId":"reference:0b0fb3f831db6b3c"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +3; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkvision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Jawaese, Jawa Trade Language; Natively Phonetic\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 12 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wi